        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Topics: bivalve larvae feed, cosmetic properties, hair-straightening properties\n- Substances: hexane, ethyl acetate, ethanol, water, methanol, dimethyl carbinol\n\nFacts:\n- An outstanding food for various bivalve larvae is described as having cosmetic properties.\n- An outstanding food for various bivalve larvae is described as having hair-straightening properties.\n- The stated cosmetic and hair-straightening properties are associated with extracts made using hexane, ethyl acetate, ethanol, water, methanol, or dimethyl carbinol.",
